                                                               ; HALVE  the byte at this cell  with q t and f in the
                                                               ; three cells above it; q becomes it shifted right one
                                                               ; and t the bit that fell off; the pointer comes back
                                                               ; here; CONVENTIONS section 5 carries the vocabulary
                                                               ; entry;
  [->>>+<[-<+>>-<]>[-<+>]<<<]
